<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month bill yield drops to 22.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month bill yield drops to 22.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.23 percent, down from 22.38 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Wednesday HTBN.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     11,764.40 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.23 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.7488 pct</p>
</text>
